      trivia: "For four years, no business in Piedecuesta had managed to complete a cigar export. Colpuros broke that drought by shipping premium cigars to Germany, and it is also the first premium-cigar producer to obtain the mark of origin ‘Made in Santander’ — a mark whose requirements include a record of exports of Santander origin verifiable in official databases."
